{"id":832,"date":"2025-08-22T10:04:59","date_gmt":"2025-08-22T10:04:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/bombayfoodstuff\/?post_type=product&#038;p=832"},"modified":"2025-08-28T08:08:29","modified_gmt":"2025-08-28T08:08:29","slug":"long-pepper","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/product\/long-pepper\/","title":{"rendered":"Long Pepper"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2><b>Long Pepper<\/b><\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Name:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Long Pepper<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Botanical Name:<\/b> <i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Piper longum<\/span><\/i>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Family Name:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Piperaceae<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Commercial Part:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Dried Fruit (spikes)<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><b>Product Description<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Long Pepper is an ancient spice resembling a slender catkin, made up of tiny fruits clustered on a flower spike. Native to India and Southeast Asia, it has a more complex flavor than black pepper, combining heat with subtle sweetness. Valued in Ayurveda and traditional cuisines, it is both a culinary and medicinal treasure.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Applications<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Culinary:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Used in Indian vegetable pickles, spice mixtures, curries, and traditional Indonesian &amp; Malaysian cooking.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Seasoning:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Enhances marinades, stews, and aromatic rice dishes.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Industrial:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Flavoring in sauces, spice blends, and condiments.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Medicinal:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Commonly used in Ayurveda for digestion and respiratory wellness.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><b>Nutritional &amp; Health Benefits<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aids digestion and stimulates appetite.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Contains antioxidants with anti-inflammatory properties.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Supports respiratory health and helps in colds.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Traditionally used in Ayurveda for detox and immunity.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Natural source of vitamins and minerals.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><b>Why Choose Bombay Foodstuff Long Pepper?<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Authentic sourcing from trusted farms.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hygienically processed to preserve natural aroma.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Available in bulk for global markets.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Strong, pure flavor ideal for culinary and medicinal uses.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Reliable exporter with consistent quality assurance.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"